        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.61,
            0.41,
            0.629
          ],
          "content": "We observe the following:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.634,
            0.846,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": "• The magnitude of the product does not change with the change in the signs of the multiplier and the multiplicand."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.676,
            0.846,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "When both the multiplier and the multiplicand are **positive**, the product is **positive**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.719,
            0.846,
            0.759
          ],
          "content": "When both the multiplier and the multiplicand are **negative**, the product is **positive**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.762,
            0.847,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": "When one of the multiplier or the multiplicand is **positive** and the other is negative, their product is **negative**."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.811,
            0.315,
            0.835
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.845,
            0.43,
            0.864
          ],
          "content": "Find the following products."
        },
